    "guide": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "```sh\nflavor=night\ncurl -fsSL --create-dirs -o \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/foot/living-code-$flavor.ini\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/living-code-theme/foot/main/living-code-$flavor.ini\"\n```\n\nThen include it at the top of `foot.ini`:\n\n```ini\n[main]\ninclude=~/.config/foot/living-code-night.ini\n```\n\nIf you set `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, use that path in the `include` line.",
      "configuration": "See [foot's documentation](https://codeberg.org/dnkl/foot) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
      "compatibility": "Requires a foot release supporting [colors-dark] and [colors-light] (foot 1.23 or newer). Paper selects the light color theme.",
